  "html": "<p>Quests in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>.  This dungeon and its quests have been entirely re-done in Build 121, and a whole new theme developed.  <a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Ving_N'Seacressy\" title=\"Sir Ving N'Seacressy\">Sir Ving N'Seacressy</a> gives everything an interesting twist.  To keep it a surprise for Dungeon Runners working through it, certain details of the quests have been omitted for you to discover for yourself.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-subcategories\">\n<h2>Subcategories</h2>\n<p>There are 7 subcategories to this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>'</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:'Facts_Quest_Line\" title=\"Category:'Facts Quest Line\">'Facts Quest Line</a></li></ul>\n<h3>C</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Corpse_Run_Quests\" title=\"Category:Corpse Run Quests\">Corpse Run Quests</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>K</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:King's_Coin_Counterfeit_Conspiracy_Quests\" title=\"Category:King's Coin Counterfeit Conspiracy Quests\">King's Coin Counterfeit Conspiracy Quests</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:King's_Hit_List_Quests\" title=\"Category:King's Hit List Quests\">King's Hit List Quests</a></li></ul>\n<h3>M</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Missing_Man_Quests\" title=\"Category:Missing Man Quests\">Missing Man Quests</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>R</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Revengeance_Quests\" title=\"Category:Revengeance Quests\">Revengeance Quests</a></li></ul>\n<h3>S</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Seeking_Secrets_Quests\" title=\"Category:Seeking Secrets Quests\">Seeking Secrets Quests</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div><div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Shadow's Embrace Quests\"</h2>\n<p>There are 44 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>C</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Corpse_Run_Part_1\" title=\"Corpse Ru